---
import Icon from "astro-icon";
---

<section id= "clients" class="manager-message">
  <div class="overlay"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="avatar">
      <Icon
        pack="mdi"
        name="account-tie"
        size={58}
      />
    </div>

    <h3>Juan Carlos Cerna</h3>

    <span class="position">
      Gerente General y Jefe Administrativo
    </span>

    <div class="stars">
      ★★★★★
    </div>

    <p>
      Fue un verdadero placer trabajar con ustedes. Nos alegra enormemente saber que quedaron satisfechos con la organización y el profesionalismo de nuestro equipo. Es un orgullo contar con clientes como ustedes y esperamos seguir colaborando en el futuro
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
.manager-message {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;

  padding: 7rem 7%;

  background-image: url("/images/clientes-bg.webp");
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-attachment: fixed;

  .overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;

    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88) 0%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72) 50%,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88) 100%
    );
  }

  .container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;

    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;

    text-align: center;

    .avatar {
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;

      margin: 0 auto 1.8rem;

      border-radius: 50%;

      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        #2563eb,
        #38bdf8
      );

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      color: white;

      border: 4px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);

      box-shadow:
        0 20px 45px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);

      svg {
        width: 58px;
        height: 58px;
      }
    }

    h3 {
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .position {
      display: block;

      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);

      font-size: 1.1rem;

      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .stars {
      color: #fbbf24;

      font-size: 1.35rem;

      letter-spacing: 4px;

      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    p {
      max-width: 900px;

      margin: 0 auto;

      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);

      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-style: italic;

      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .quote {
      position: absolute;

      color: #fbbf24;

      font-size: 5rem;
      font-weight: 700;

      line-height: 1;

      opacity: 0.9;

      &.quote-left {
        left: -20px;
        top: 55%;
      }

      &.quote-right {
        right: -20px;
        bottom: -15px;
      }
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    background-attachment: scroll;

    padding: 5rem 5%;

    .container {
      .avatar {
        width: 95px;
        height: 95px;

        svg {
          width: 42px;
          height: 42px;
        }
      }

      h3 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .quote {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;

    .container {
      .avatar {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;

        svg {
          width: 35px;
          height: 35px;
        }
      }

      h3 {
        font-size: 1.6rem;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }
    }
  }
}
</style>